sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant BFF as Next.js BFF
  participant API as NestJS Auth
  participant Redis

  Browser->>BFF: POST /api/auth/login
  BFF->>API: POST /auth/login
  API-->>BFF: access + refresh tokens
  BFF-->>Browser: Set httpOnly cookies + session hint

  Browser->>BFF: GET /api/backend/admin/users
  BFF->>BFF: Read accessToken cookie
  BFF->>API: GET /admin/users (Bearer)
  API-->>BFF: 200 JSON
  BFF-->>Browser: Proxied response

  Browser->>BFF: POST /api/auth/refresh (+ CSRF)
  BFF->>API: POST /auth/refresh
  API->>Redis: Validate refresh blacklist
  API-->>BFF: New tokens
  BFF-->>Browser: Rotated httpOnly cookies
